eshed head: 6b4d7afefb1b98c2fe06c1dceada279d4c21c055; ordered parents: original reviewed head36c29bb039471f132889d577c9322d78925b62dd and main6dab96e6a1579056b35ff0b4c35c7c1acfa7c8cd. Its54 changed paths comprise53 unchanged target files and QUEUE.md. At physical line412/rank401, only problem30004293's cells8/9 change queued0/5 to unsolved5/5; every other queue byte is preserved. The earlier WIP is verified ancestry and42 immutable author-file bytes, not the refreshed head's second parent. All220 nested manifest bindings and five checkpoints verify.\n\nAll150925 author assertions and8390 historical independent assertions reproduce as complete streams. The historical42-file author-only replay reports120 binding occurrences; current replay sees52 further publication bindings and reports172. The current public wrapper's optional PDF count is0; a separate original author-only replay verifies all5 sources, and5 freshly obtained primary PDF hashes agree. Fresh family programs reproduce fully, with only explicitly recorded UTC/runtime differences for two diagonal programs. Finite checks supplement written universal arguments.\n\nGreen's entire source contribution and FGK's full prefix tensor lemma/proof/remark were read directly. The published lower threshold input is credited; its entire long entropy proof is not reconstructed. The latest inspected Mao–Song v2 fixed-threshold claims and the divisor-power paper supply no assumed sharp-prefix transfer; their complete proofs are not independently audited here. Historical source eligibility is bounded provenance, without exhaustive present-day novelty/open-status certification. No novelty certification is claimed. Third-party PDF/text/render material and private replay inputs are excluded from public artifacts.\n\nAI tools were used extensively in research, drafting, verification and adversarial review. This work is unrefereed and has not received external human peer review. Actual acceptance is recorded separately after the 